1
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,280
(Street World Fighter: Directors' War)

2
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,980
(This program contains indirect advertisements.)

3
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,850
On October 3,

4
00:00:15,033 --> 00:00:17,703
the third Last Stage: 24H was revealed.

5
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:20,343
After the Super Kids Direct Mission,

6
00:00:20,343 --> 00:00:22,203
the four directors who lost are...

7
00:00:22,203 --> 00:00:24,943
up on the Last Stage again.

8
00:00:25,313 --> 00:00:26,313
BADA.

9
00:00:26,413 --> 00:00:27,513
Simeez.

10
00:00:27,583 --> 00:00:28,683
INGYOO.

11
00:00:28,683 --> 00:00:29,743
JEONG MIN JUN.

12
00:00:30,013 --> 00:00:31,983
The four directors are given...

13
00:00:32,082 --> 00:00:33,652
only 24 hours.

14
00:00:33,922 --> 00:00:37,322
The condition given for the Last Stage: 24H.

15
00:00:37,652 --> 00:00:38,722
It is...

16
00:00:38,892 --> 00:00:40,022
umbrellas.

17
00:00:43,762 --> 00:00:46,632
Umbrellas are one of the objects we're most familiar with...

18
00:00:46,632 --> 00:00:49,762
designed to avoid rain.

19
00:00:49,832 --> 00:00:53,132
However, when umbrellas meet lights and videos,

20
00:00:53,302 --> 00:00:55,202
they could turn into a flower field...

21
00:00:57,012 --> 00:00:58,872
or an endless desert...

22
00:01:00,912 --> 00:01:02,582
or a digital space...

23
00:01:04,678 --> 00:01:06,148
or even a new world.

24
00:01:07,848 --> 00:01:11,688
They become objects that create numerous scenes.

25
00:01:12,018 --> 00:01:13,018
(Screaming)

26
00:01:13,018 --> 00:01:14,518
This is driving me crazy.

27
00:01:14,518 --> 00:01:17,158
Actually, I wanted to give up.

28
00:01:17,158 --> 00:01:18,258
(Losing her mind)

29
00:01:18,258 --> 00:01:19,628
This is crazy.

30
00:01:19,858 --> 00:01:21,698
I want to get rid of them all.

31
00:01:22,428 --> 00:01:23,598
I don't care who gets eliminated.

32
00:01:23,598 --> 00:01:25,028
Because I'm going to survive no matter what.

33
00:01:25,028 --> 00:01:27,038
This is made for me.

34
00:01:27,138 --> 00:01:28,338
I can't wait to dance.

35
00:01:28,338 --> 00:01:30,198
I can't wait to show it to people.

36
00:01:30,198 --> 00:01:31,208
It's going to be fun.

37
00:01:31,208 --> 00:01:32,238
It's going to be really intense.

38
00:01:33,168 --> 00:01:35,838
Director BADA...

39
00:01:35,838 --> 00:01:39,208
used umbrellas and the projection depicted a flower blooming...

40
00:01:39,208 --> 00:01:40,778
from a bud.

41
00:01:41,748 --> 00:01:44,618
Director Simeez turned umbrellas...

42
00:01:44,618 --> 00:01:46,188
to an angel's wings, shields, and prison...

43
00:01:46,188 --> 00:01:49,418
and depicted the process...

44
00:01:49,418 --> 00:01:51,128
of a fallen angel.

45
00:01:52,058 --> 00:01:54,558
Director INGYOO turned...

46
00:01:54,728 --> 00:01:55,898
the umbrellas to ninjas' swords...

47
00:01:55,898 --> 00:01:58,868
and used the projection...

48
00:01:58,868 --> 00:02:00,498
to describe the ninjas' mission cheerfully.

49
00:02:02,498 --> 00:02:04,138
Director JEONG MIN JUN completed an intense opening...

50
00:02:04,138 --> 00:02:06,238
by flipping umbrellas and using lights.

51
00:02:06,238 --> 00:02:08,978
He then used umbrellas to describe...

52
00:02:08,978 --> 00:02:12,548
weapons and the Trojan Horse to complete the epic of the Odyssey.

53
00:02:13,078 --> 00:02:16,078
I will announce the first eliminated person...

54
00:02:16,548 --> 00:02:19,288
of the third Last Stage: 24H.

55
00:02:19,288 --> 00:02:20,288
The eliminated person is...

56
00:02:20,558 --> 00:02:21,618
JEONG MIN JUN.

57
00:02:21,618 --> 00:02:22,788
(Eliminated choreographer: JEONG MIN JUN)

58
00:02:22,988 --> 00:02:24,088
Simeez.

59
00:02:24,088 --> 00:02:25,188
(Eliminated choreographer: Simeez)

60
00:02:25,388 --> 00:02:27,498
I really enjoyed watching it, MIN JUN.

61
00:02:27,628 --> 00:02:29,228
You're guaranteed to thrive.

62
00:02:29,228 --> 00:02:31,728
So you can go home with a smile.

63
00:02:31,728 --> 00:02:34,068
Simeez, you're full of potential.

64
00:02:34,068 --> 00:02:35,968
Just as you've been doing,

65
00:02:35,968 --> 00:02:38,608
I look forward to seeing your new world.

66
00:02:38,608 --> 00:02:39,708
Well done.

67
00:02:40,378 --> 00:02:43,808
(You can watch their full video on "The CHOOM" and "Mnet Plus.")

68
00:02:43,808 --> 00:02:44,878
(After the Last Stage)

69
00:02:44,878 --> 00:02:47,018
It smells different.

70
00:02:47,348 --> 00:02:50,118
(Opening the door to his Director's Room for the last time)

71
00:02:50,648 --> 00:02:52,548
So now,

72
00:02:52,548 --> 00:02:55,118
it's time to leave this place.

73
00:02:55,858 --> 00:02:57,758
I can't believe the day has come to put this away.

74
00:02:58,188 --> 00:03:00,928
- When I first joined this show, - Hello.

75
00:03:00,928 --> 00:03:03,398
I wasn't sure about myself.

76
00:03:03,398 --> 00:03:04,968
(What I realized here was...)

77
00:03:04,968 --> 00:03:06,228
(that it's really intense.)

78
00:03:06,228 --> 00:03:07,238
(Who? JEONG MIN JUN?)

79
00:03:07,238 --> 00:03:08,238
(Never heard of his name before)

80
00:03:08,238 --> 00:03:10,908
(He joined his first survival show with passion and confidence.)

81
00:03:11,138 --> 00:03:14,238
(Harsh criticisms on MIN JUN)

82
00:03:14,278 --> 00:03:16,438
Oh, my gosh. He'll be the first one to be eliminated.

83
00:03:16,738 --> 00:03:18,908
- They disregarded me. - That's mean.

84
00:03:18,908 --> 00:03:21,948
I couldn't stop thinking...

85
00:03:21,948 --> 00:03:23,348
about how fragile I was.

86
00:03:23,818 --> 00:03:25,188
Then eventually,

87
00:03:25,188 --> 00:03:27,918
people approved...

88
00:03:27,918 --> 00:03:30,528
of my dance style.

89
00:03:30,728 --> 00:03:32,428
A lot of people liked it.

90
00:03:32,428 --> 00:03:34,098
Well done.

91
00:03:34,098 --> 00:03:35,828
I made friends with nine people.

92
00:03:35,828 --> 00:03:37,668
(Protecting MIN JUN)

93
00:03:37,798 --> 00:03:38,998
Good job, MIN JUN.

94
00:03:39,198 --> 00:03:41,138
Let's go for a meal together next time.

95
00:03:41,138 --> 00:03:42,138
Sounds good to me.

96
00:03:42,138 --> 00:03:44,338
When you joined that team,

97
00:03:44,608 --> 00:03:45,808
did you realize how good I was?

98
00:03:45,808 --> 00:03:47,708
(He never stops showing off.)

99
00:03:47,878 --> 00:03:50,238
I had a really tough time during the K-pop mission.

100
00:03:50,238 --> 00:03:52,578
He basically felt like my savior.

101
00:03:53,678 --> 00:03:55,648
I got to work with capable choreographers,

102
00:03:55,648 --> 00:03:57,018
learn K-pop,

103
00:03:57,018 --> 00:04:00,518
and learn to direct young dancers.

104
00:04:00,518 --> 00:04:02,358
I learned so much.

105
00:04:02,688 --> 00:04:04,328
You're darn crazy.

106
00:04:04,458 --> 00:04:05,488
Just like what the judges said.

107
00:04:05,488 --> 00:04:07,558
You'll be successful.

108
00:04:07,558 --> 00:04:10,928
(Simeez also opens the door to her Director's Room for the last time.)

109
00:04:14,698 --> 00:04:15,998
Oh, gosh.

110
00:04:15,998 --> 00:04:17,168
I didn't know I had these here.

111
00:04:17,308 --> 00:04:19,938
(Simeez spots the knife props from her first mission.)

112
00:04:20,168 --> 00:04:21,178
This reminds me...

113
00:04:21,178 --> 00:04:23,508
of all my efforts

114
00:04:23,508 --> 00:04:27,818
(She never wasted even a moment.)

115
00:04:28,078 --> 00:04:29,318
I was sincere on stage.

116
00:04:29,318 --> 00:04:30,988
I enjoyed every mission.

117
00:04:30,988 --> 00:04:33,818
I got through it in my own way.

118
00:04:33,818 --> 00:04:36,588
(The golden youngest returned in light pink.)

119
00:04:36,588 --> 00:04:40,328
(Her new challenge as a director began.)

120
00:04:40,498 --> 00:04:42,028
(She built a lot of experience as a director...)

121
00:04:42,028 --> 00:04:43,558
(after "Street Woman Fighter.")

122
00:04:43,558 --> 00:04:48,668
(She grew up to be a golden director who leads the stage.)

123
00:04:48,838 --> 00:04:52,108
It feels like I'm trying something new every day.

124
00:04:52,108 --> 00:04:54,908
Everything feels new.

125
00:04:54,908 --> 00:04:56,438
I was completely immersed.

126
00:04:56,608 --> 00:04:58,808
Do you know what it feels like to take the lead every time?

127
00:04:58,808 --> 00:05:01,118
I'm held accountable...

128
00:05:01,118 --> 00:05:03,318
- for everything I say. - You shouldn't go this way.

129
00:05:03,318 --> 00:05:04,718
(The weight of director who has to hold accountable for everything)

130
00:05:04,718 --> 00:05:08,388
It was heavier than I expected.

131
00:05:08,918 --> 00:05:10,158
When I watched your performance today,

132
00:05:10,158 --> 00:05:12,828
I was reminded once again of how amazing you are.

133
00:05:12,828 --> 00:05:13,998
Your challenge.

134
00:05:15,158 --> 00:05:16,558
Your drive.

135
00:05:16,558 --> 00:05:17,698
And your energy.

136
00:05:17,698 --> 00:05:20,228
It's not something anyone can catch up with.

137
00:05:20,228 --> 00:05:21,498
I hope your talent...

138
00:05:21,498 --> 00:05:24,268
continues to shine through in different areas.

139
00:05:24,268 --> 00:05:25,938
And I'll always be rooting for you.

140
00:05:26,138 --> 00:05:28,178
I want to be a director...

141
00:05:28,178 --> 00:05:30,578
who is as unique as I am.

142
00:05:30,848 --> 00:05:33,048
"That's what she wants to do."

143
00:05:33,048 --> 00:05:34,278
"That's what she's good at."

144
00:05:34,278 --> 00:05:36,048
If anyone recognizes that even a little,

145
00:05:36,048 --> 00:05:39,288
I wouldn't regret my decision to join this show.

146
00:05:40,348 --> 00:05:41,858
You look tired.

147
00:05:42,188 --> 00:05:43,988
- You look tired. - No.

148
00:05:44,188 --> 00:05:45,828
- Hee Jung. - Yes.

149
00:05:46,628 --> 00:05:47,828
Well done.

150
00:05:47,828 --> 00:05:48,828
(Well done.)

151
00:05:48,998 --> 00:05:51,268
(Leaving her last message)

152
00:05:55,668 --> 00:05:56,698
The end.

153
00:05:58,238 --> 00:06:00,908
(I finished everything as who I am. Good job, Simeez!)

154
00:06:01,178 --> 00:06:04,148
It's my quality as a golden director.

155
00:06:04,978 --> 00:06:06,108
I've become one.

156
00:06:06,108 --> 00:06:07,378
(I've become a golden director.)

157
00:06:08,248 --> 00:06:11,018
From the start to the end,

158
00:06:11,518 --> 00:06:14,318
I did my best as a director.

159
00:06:15,988 --> 00:06:17,788
I have no lingering feelings and no regrets.

160
00:06:20,628 --> 00:06:22,828
My stories have...

161
00:06:22,828 --> 00:06:24,598
only started.

162
00:06:24,598 --> 00:06:26,528
Please look forward...

163
00:06:26,528 --> 00:06:28,198
to who I am as a person.

164
00:06:29,738 --> 00:06:31,468
It was a good game.

165
00:06:32,108 --> 00:06:33,168
Good game.

166
00:06:34,078 --> 00:06:35,308
Thank you...

167
00:06:35,678 --> 00:06:39,348
for watching my growth.

168
00:06:40,578 --> 00:06:41,818
Bye.

169
00:06:41,818 --> 00:06:44,088
(JEONG MIN JUN)

170
00:06:45,748 --> 00:06:48,158
(The warmth may be gone,)

171
00:06:48,158 --> 00:06:50,218
(but the passion lasts forever.)

172
00:07:16,318 --> 00:07:17,648
The most intense stage before the final,

173
00:07:17,648 --> 00:07:19,988
the semifinal.

174
00:07:19,988 --> 00:07:21,518
Here is your mission.

175
00:07:22,658 --> 00:07:24,288
It's the one I've wanted to do the most.

176
00:07:24,288 --> 00:07:25,288
(Complete...)

177
00:07:25,288 --> 00:07:26,288
(5 different solo performances...)

178
00:07:26,288 --> 00:07:27,298
(in the brand film.)

179
00:07:27,298 --> 00:07:28,698
The benefit is too great.

180
00:07:28,698 --> 00:07:30,128
I want it.

181
00:07:30,128 --> 00:07:31,798
I'll go first.

182
00:07:31,798 --> 00:07:32,898
My concept is...

183
00:07:32,898 --> 00:07:34,198
the spirit.

184
00:07:34,198 --> 00:07:35,268
Yes!

185
00:07:35,268 --> 00:07:36,738
(Yes?)

186
00:07:36,738 --> 00:07:39,038
You'll have to fix your concept a lot.

187
00:07:39,038 --> 00:07:42,038
But is it really worth changing it?

188
00:07:42,038 --> 00:07:43,948
I was quite disappointed in myself.

189
00:07:43,948 --> 00:07:46,008
It wasn't what I expected at all.

190
00:07:46,008 --> 00:07:47,208
It looks like I made a mistake.

191
00:07:47,208 --> 00:07:48,448
Koo Young is too greedy.

192
00:07:48,948 --> 00:07:50,918
I want to work with this director.

193
00:07:50,918 --> 00:07:52,488
You can't find a director like me.

194
00:07:52,488 --> 00:07:53,618
Who's it going to be?

195
00:07:53,618 --> 00:07:55,118
I don't care as long as I'm safe.

196
00:07:55,118 --> 00:07:57,588
- We can only pick one. - Right.

197
00:07:57,588 --> 00:07:59,028
Where are they going?

198
00:07:59,028 --> 00:08:00,228
Are they heading to Koo Young's room?

199
00:08:00,698 --> 00:08:02,128
They're heading to Koo Young's room.

200
00:08:02,128 --> 00:08:03,658
Oh, my gosh.

201
00:08:03,758 --> 00:08:05,028
What? Are they coming to me?

202
00:08:05,028 --> 00:08:06,228
They only chose Koo Young?

203
00:08:06,228 --> 00:08:07,668
(Director Back Koo Young receives a mysterious letter.)

204
00:08:09,398 --> 00:08:11,008
The result of the only one who enters the final.

205
00:08:11,008 --> 00:08:12,008
(Is this the ticket straight to the final?)

206
00:08:12,008 --> 00:08:14,478
(What does it say in the letter?)

207
00:08:14,478 --> 00:08:15,838
(The Brand Performance Film Mission begins now.)

208
00:08:15,838 --> 00:08:16,938
Okay.

209
00:08:16,938 --> 00:08:18,348
I'll see you in the final.

210
00:08:19,678 --> 00:08:22,278
The most intense stage before the final,

211
00:08:22,278 --> 00:08:23,518
the semifinal.

212
00:08:24,218 --> 00:08:26,918
The directing competition that began with ten directors...

213
00:08:27,818 --> 00:08:30,258
has gone through numerous choices and competitions.

214
00:08:30,728 --> 00:08:32,088
Back Koo Young, BABYZOO,

215
00:08:32,088 --> 00:08:34,028
Kasper, BADA, INGYOO.

216
00:08:34,258 --> 00:08:36,398
Only five of them remain.

217
00:08:36,398 --> 00:08:37,968
The semifinal mission is...

218
00:08:37,968 --> 00:08:39,228
What kind of mission is it?

219
00:08:39,228 --> 00:08:40,768
To express the global smartphone brand...

220
00:08:40,768 --> 00:08:43,198
that is loved around the world.

221
00:08:43,798 --> 00:08:46,108
It's the Brand Performance Film Mission.

222
00:08:46,108 --> 00:08:47,138
Oh, my gosh.

223
00:08:47,308 --> 00:08:49,178
Do we get to film it?

224
00:08:50,308 --> 00:08:51,678
A brand performance?

225
00:08:51,678 --> 00:08:53,778
I keep hearing something new every time.

226
00:08:53,778 --> 00:08:54,778
This film...

227
00:08:54,778 --> 00:08:58,448
doesn't just end as a mission.

228
00:08:59,088 --> 00:09:00,588
What does that mean?

229
00:09:00,588 --> 00:09:03,118
Part of your performance film...

230
00:09:03,118 --> 00:09:06,788
will be used in the global smartphone brand's commercial.

231
00:09:06,788 --> 00:09:07,798
(Incredible chance)

232
00:09:07,798 --> 00:09:08,798
Amazing.

233
00:09:08,798 --> 00:09:11,368
While you participate...

234
00:09:11,368 --> 00:09:13,298
in the performance you direct,

235
00:09:13,298 --> 00:09:14,738
you also...

236
00:09:14,738 --> 00:09:17,768
perform as the global smartphone brand's model.

237
00:09:18,038 --> 00:09:19,468
(Performing as the global smartphone brand's model)

238
00:09:19,568 --> 00:09:20,568
That's huge.

239
00:09:20,878 --> 00:09:23,378
That's awesome.

240
00:09:23,608 --> 00:09:25,908
It's something everyone wants to try at least once.

241
00:09:25,908 --> 00:09:28,318
That's crazy. I've always wanted to try...

242
00:09:28,318 --> 00:09:29,818
a smartphone commercial.

243
00:09:29,818 --> 00:09:31,788
Is it my dream come true?

244
00:09:31,788 --> 00:09:34,518
However, this opportunity is...

245
00:09:34,518 --> 00:09:37,288
- given to only 1 director. - Only 1?

246
00:09:37,288 --> 00:09:40,158
A global smartphone brand's commercial model?

247
00:09:40,158 --> 00:09:41,358
I'm dying to do it.

248
00:09:41,458 --> 00:09:43,128
I've never wanted anything so badly before.

249
00:09:43,398 --> 00:09:45,128
I have to get this.

250
00:09:45,128 --> 00:09:46,868
This has to be mine.

251
00:09:46,968 --> 00:09:48,538
I have nothing left to regret.

252
00:09:48,538 --> 00:09:50,368
I really have no regrets except for one thing.

253
00:09:50,368 --> 00:09:52,108
A global model? That sounds cool.

254
00:09:52,108 --> 00:09:53,308
I really want it.

255
00:09:53,308 --> 00:09:55,538
But I never showed that I want it.

256
00:09:55,538 --> 00:09:58,948
I tend to be the quiet one that fools everyone.

257
00:09:58,948 --> 00:10:01,678
It's a chance to become a model...

258
00:10:01,678 --> 00:10:03,148
for the smartphone the whole world goes crazy about...

259
00:10:03,148 --> 00:10:05,188
and become the lead in that film.

260
00:10:05,188 --> 00:10:06,718
That's the biggest perk.

261
00:10:06,718 --> 00:10:08,518
I want it so bad.

262
00:10:08,518 --> 00:10:10,888
I want to be its director so bad.

263
00:10:10,888 --> 00:10:13,928
I will explain how the final director is selected.

264
00:10:13,928 --> 00:10:17,928
Five choreographers will produce their own solo performance films.

265
00:10:17,928 --> 00:10:19,698
It'll be the highlight of the film...

266
00:10:19,698 --> 00:10:22,038
as well as the most important part of the commercial.

267
00:10:22,398 --> 00:10:25,168
All five will be given the same concept,

268
00:10:25,168 --> 00:10:26,768
planning, and production conditions.

269
00:10:27,308 --> 00:10:30,078
Only the one with the most perfect film...

270
00:10:30,078 --> 00:10:32,708
will become the final director of this mission.

271
00:10:32,808 --> 00:10:35,218
Not only the winner will receive the ticket to enter the final,

272
00:10:35,218 --> 00:10:37,448
but also the power...

273
00:10:37,448 --> 00:10:39,948
to save one of the choreographers...

274
00:10:39,948 --> 00:10:43,588
from the Last Stage: 24H.

275
00:10:43,588 --> 00:10:45,888
The winner gets to save one person from the Last Stage.

276
