1096
00:42:15,978 --> 00:42:18,018
- That felt very iconic. - Right.

1097
00:42:18,018 --> 00:42:19,148
It gave off Korean vibes.

1098
00:42:19,148 --> 00:42:21,588
It made me think, "He came up with this?"

1099
00:42:21,588 --> 00:42:23,988
But I was slightly confused...

1100
00:42:23,988 --> 00:42:28,558
