1110
00:42:47,178 --> 00:42:49,248
- Right. I felt the same. - Right.

1111
00:42:49,248 --> 00:42:50,578
If that draft is to be used,

1112
00:42:50,578 --> 00:42:52,278
you would have to change...

1113
00:42:52,278 --> 00:42:54,018
