1114
00:42:54,018 --> 00:42:58,088
The wide cut wasn't that great for the mega crew.

1115
00:42:58,088 --> 00:43:00,088
- The moves were too simple. - Right.

1116
00:43:00,088 --> 00:43:02,798
I thought that there wasn't much to see.

1117
00:43:02,798 --> 00:43:04,258
- That was what was disappointing. - Right.

1118
00:43:04,398 --> 00:43:05,998
As for Kasper,

1119
00:43:05,998 --> 00:43:09,998
