1129
00:43:30,118 --> 00:43:32,288
Right. I agree with that.

1130
00:43:32,288 --> 00:43:33,328
As for Back Koo Young,

1131
00:43:33,328 --> 00:43:35,358
I was surprised by him...

1132
00:43:35,358 --> 00:43:36,728
