Koo Young's part felt too strong.

1138
00:43:53,308 --> 00:43:55,678
I wasn't able to understand the flow.

1139
00:43:55,678 --> 00:43:58,248
There wasn't a certain connection...

1140
00:43:58,248 --> 00:44:00,548
