1141
00:44:00,548 --> 00:44:03,288
His energy as a solo character was great.

1142
00:44:03,288 --> 00:44:05,758
His concept was really impactful.

1143
00:44:05,758 --> 00:44:08,028
But in my opinion,

1144
00:44:08,028 --> 00:44:09,458
