1153
00:44:31,948 --> 00:44:33,588
and her energy from dancing.

1154
00:44:33,588 --> 00:44:35,888
The aura she possesses feels so strong.

1155
00:44:35,888 --> 00:44:39,758
But this is her blank point.

1156
00:44:40,058 --> 00:44:41,328
The mega crew.

1157
00:44:41,388 --> 00:44:43,728
- Right. That was missing. - The mega crew...

1158
00:44:43,728 --> 00:44:46,928
