1159
00:44:48,098 --> 00:44:50,698
I should've done a better job.

1160
00:44:50,698 --> 00:44:54,768
I had so many things I wanted to express as a mega crew.

1161
00:44:54,768 --> 00:44:57,108
I should've put that in the draft.

1162
00:44:57,108 --> 00:44:59,308
As it wasn't expressed in the draft,

1163
