1164
00:45:01,348 --> 00:45:03,248
Why am I like this?

1165
00:45:03,278 --> 00:45:05,448
BADA's draft was impressive.

1166
00:45:05,448 --> 00:45:07,288
It felt like, "I am BADA."

1167
00:45:07,488 --> 00:45:10,658
She put in a lot of her iconic features.

1168
00:45:10,658 --> 00:45:14,528
But I wasn't sure if that could bring out a great response.

1169
00:45:14,528 --> 00:45:17,428
But the model is charming.

1170
00:45:17,658 --> 00:45:19,628
I admit that the figure is charming.

1171
00:45:19,628 --> 00:45:21,398
She's captivating and charming...

1172
00:45:21,398 --> 00:45:23,298
with her eyes and such.

1173
00:45:23,438 --> 00:45:26,708
I gave her a perfect score for this part.

1174
00:45:27,938 --> 00:45:30,278
To be honest, her figure was outstandingly charming...

1175
00:45:30,278 --> 00:45:33,178
compared to the others.

1176
00:45:33,178 --> 00:45:34,348
I also thought...

1177
00:45:34,348 --> 00:45:36,178
- she stood out. - She stood out.

1178
00:45:36,178 --> 00:45:38,348
Also, she prepared...

1179
00:45:38,348 --> 00:45:41,248
- many iconic moves. - Right.

1180
00:45:41,248 --> 00:45:43,358
I thought she had great ideas...

1181
00:45:43,358 --> 00:45:44,858
and was impressed by that.

1182
00:45:44,858 --> 00:45:46,118
(Moves that expressed iconic gestures)

1183
00:45:46,288 --> 00:45:48,358
This felt iconic to me.

1184
00:45:48,858 --> 00:45:51,328
She filmed the video herself...

1185
00:45:51,328 --> 00:45:54,428
