1188
00:45:59,538 --> 00:46:02,268
I thought she did well to utilize the space.

1189
00:46:02,268 --> 00:46:04,178
Those ending scenes can never be...

1190
00:46:04,638 --> 00:46:07,648
- thought of by directors. - Right.

1191
00:46:07,648 --> 00:46:09,878
- I can never imagine that. - Right.

1192
00:46:09,878 --> 00:46:11,748
- It might not turn out nicely. - Right.

1193
00:46:11,748 --> 00:46:14,988
But the problem is that the next video surprised me.

1194
00:46:15,248 --> 00:46:17,018
- It was... - Another strong contestant.

1195
00:46:17,358 --> 00:46:19,928
BABYZOO was meticulous with his work...

1196
00:46:19,928 --> 00:46:22,358
and produced something of great quality.

1197
00:46:22,358 --> 00:46:23,358
Right.

1198
00:46:23,358 --> 00:46:25,528
I thought that the level of completion...

1199
00:46:25,528 --> 00:46:27,968
- was flawless. - Right.

1200
00:46:27,968 --> 00:46:30,398
This was what I personally felt.

1201
00:46:30,638 --> 00:46:33,168
"Could he be less impactful when he's alone?"

1202
00:46:33,168 --> 00:46:34,338
This was the thought I got.

1203
00:46:34,338 --> 00:46:35,908
He might have less of an impact...

1204
00:46:35,908 --> 00:46:38,838
when he's performing on his own.

1205
00:46:39,178 --> 00:46:42,208
Jun Hui came up with wow factor with the directing.

1206
00:46:42,208 --> 00:46:44,748
But the dancing was quite disappointing.

1207
00:46:44,748 --> 00:46:46,218
As for the model,

1208
00:46:46,218 --> 00:46:48,188
the style of dancing has a great influence.

1209
00:46:48,188 --> 00:46:51,258
The appearance is important as well.

1210
00:46:51,458 --> 00:46:53,728
Gosh, this is killing me.

1211
00:46:54,588 --> 00:46:56,558
Before we could even think about it,

1212
00:46:56,558 --> 00:46:59,798
BABYZOO divided up the parts in advance.

1213
00:46:59,798 --> 00:47:01,698
"He tried to express this in this part."

1214
00:47:01,698 --> 00:47:03,198
"This is the angle he wants."

1215
00:47:03,198 --> 00:47:06,338
He divided up the parts...

1216
00:47:06,338 --> 00:47:08,008
- and I was very impressed by that. - Right.

1217
00:47:08,008 --> 00:47:09,538
- It was very clear. - Right.

1218
00:47:09,538 --> 00:47:11,608
- I really liked his storyboard. - Right.

1219
00:47:11,608 --> 00:47:13,778
I thought that there were a lot of emotions expressed...

1220
00:47:13,778 --> 00:47:16,318
along with a touching point in the end.

1221
00:47:16,318 --> 00:47:18,518
- The start felt great. - It was great.

1222
00:47:18,518 --> 00:47:19,848
He stood alone while the others danced around him.

1223
00:47:19,848 --> 00:47:21,588
- It was really impactful. - It was really impactful.

1224
00:47:21,588 --> 00:47:24,518
I think it will be great to end with the other dancers.

1225
00:47:24,518 --> 00:47:25,918
Based on directing,

1226
00:47:25,918 --> 00:47:29,428
I thought that a lot of people would choose this one...

1227
00:47:29,428 --> 00:47:32,058
without knowing any of these names.

1228
00:47:32,058 --> 00:47:33,468
Right.

1229
00:47:33,468 --> 00:47:34,698
It had the biggest impact...

1230
00:47:34,698 --> 00:47:37,068
- It was touching. - based on the story.

1231
00:47:37,068 --> 00:47:39,268
The overall balance was great...

1232
00:47:39,268 --> 00:47:41,908
with his dancing, angles, and directing.

1233
00:47:41,908 --> 00:47:44,908
BABYZOO has prepared delicious ingredients to work with.

1234
00:47:44,908 --> 00:47:46,408
What's the most important factor?

1235
00:47:46,408 --> 00:47:48,308
Based on the concept of a dance film,

1236
00:47:48,308 --> 00:47:50,478
