2891
01:51:04,508 --> 01:51:06,408
(I think INGYOO is going to sing.)

2892
01:51:06,408 --> 01:51:07,408
(For real?)

2893
01:51:07,408 --> 01:51:08,708
(He's holding a microphone.)

2894
01:51:08,708 --> 01:51:10,808
(I'll do everything I can on this last stage.)

2895
01:51:10,808 --> 01:51:11,908
(I have to sing.)

2896
01:51:11,908 --> 01:51:13,248
(His debut has been finalized.)

2897
01:51:13,248 --> 01:51:14,448
(I'll turn it into "Show Me the Money.")

2898
01:51:15,818 --> 01:51:16,818
(Really?)

2899
01:51:17,588 --> 01:51:19,188
(What? For real?)

2900
01:51:19,188 --> 01:51:20,858
(INGYOO made a big play.)

2901
01:51:20,858 --> 01:51:23,318
(I think you're just incredible. I mean it.)

2902
01:51:23,318 --> 01:51:25,588
(I cannot believe he only had 24 hours.)

2903
01:51:26,128 --> 01:51:27,998
(It sent chills down my spine.)

2904
01:51:27,998 --> 01:51:30,028
(This is anyone's game now.)
